    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔧 Social Post Scheduler Setup\n\n### Schedule\nRuns **every 2 hours from 10:00-20:00** (Europe/Rome).\nCron: `0 10,12,14,16,18,20 * * *`\n\n### Platform Routing\n| Platform | Action | Setup Required |\n|----------|--------|----------------|\n| Twitter/X | Direct API post | Twitter Developer API keys |\n| Instagram | Via Buffer API | Buffer account + profile |\n| Facebook | Via Buffer API | Buffer account + profile |\n| LinkedIn | Via Buffer API | Buffer account + profile |\n| TikTok | Manual (Telegram alert) | Telegram Bot |\n| Reddit | Manual (Telegram alert) | Telegram Bot |\n| Other | Manual (Telegram alert) | Telegram Bot |\n\n### Twitter/X API Setup\n1. Apply for Twitter Developer Account\n2. Create an app at developer.twitter.com\n3. Get OAuth 2.0 credentials\n4. Add as n8n OAuth2 credential named \"Twitter/X OAuth2\"\n\n### Buffer API Setup\n1. Create Buffer account (buffer.com)\n2. Connect your social profiles\n3. Get Access Token from Buffer Developer settings\n4. Add as n8n HTTP Header Auth: `Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`\n5. Replace `YOUR_BUFFER_PROFILE_ID`\n\n### Google Sheet — \"Content Drafts\" columns:\n- `caption` or `content` — post text\n- `hashtags` — post hashtags\n- `platform` — target platform (twitter, instagram, etc.)\n- `video_script` — optional video script\n- `image_url` — optional image URL\n- `status` — Approved, Published, Notification Sent\n- `published` — true/false\n- `publish_date` — auto-set on publish\n- `created_date` or `date` — for ordering\n\n### Manual Posting Flow\nFor TikTok, Reddit, and other platforms:\n1. Content is sent to Telegram with all details\n2. Post manually on the platform\n3. Status is updated to \"Notification Sent\"\n4. Mark as \"Published\" manually in the sheet after posting",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 740
      },
      "id": "e5f6a7b8-5001-4001-8001-000000001012",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-320, 0]
    }
